Comment: 0,0:01:31.55,0:01:33.79,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HF5F4F5&\3c&H9A3AD9&}喵  喵  喵  喵  喵
Comment: 0,0:01:34.61,0:01:35.42,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HF5F4F5&\3c&H9A3AD9&}喵
Comment: 0,0:01:39.76,0:01:41.20,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H3B2CD5&}太不可思議了...
Comment: 0,0:01:42.52,0:01:44.35,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H088209&}太超模了
Comment: 0,0:01:45.62,0:01:47.27,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H088209&}令人無法抗拒
Comment: 0,0:01:50.16,0:01:53.16,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HFF2700&}在狹窄的道路上  我們巧合地相遇了
Comment: 0,0:01:53.23,0:01:56.18,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HFF2700&}立馬就被你那黑洞一樣的深邃眼神所吸引
Comment: 0,0:01:56.57,0:01:58.23,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HE618EA&}你的冷漠、温柔和誇張
Comment: 0,0:01:58.23,0:02:00.25,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HE618EA&}爲何會讓我心跳不已呢？？
Comment: 0,0:02:02.89,0:02:05.85,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H18179B&}下午可能會下雨
Comment: 0,0:02:06.03,0:02:09.11,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H18179B&}不如提前去吃午飯吧
Comment: 0,0:02:09.19,0:02:12.35,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HAB4ED9&}在陽光下盡情享受著日光浴
Comment: 0,0:02:12.35,0:02:15.35,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HAB4ED9&}這小可愛到底是何方神聖
Comment: 0,0:02:16.17,0:02:19.39,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HA99400&}從今往後  我都是屬於你的了
Comment: 0,0:02:19.39,0:02:22.47,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HA99400&}過度的深愛  讓時空也扭曲了
Comment: 0,0:02:22.47,0:02:26.37,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H0067F2&}不知不覺間  你已經成爲了我的宇宙
Comment: 0,0:02:26.39,0:02:27.36,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H0067F2&}怦怦直跳心情
Comment: 0,0:02:27.36,0:02:28.77,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H0067F2&}讓我倍感煎熬...
Comment: 0,0:02:28.77,0:02:31.94,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HFA0F7E&}説是命運也好  奇迹也罷
Comment: 0,0:02:31.94,0:02:35.01,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HFA0F7E&}我們的相遇就是宇宙大爆炸
Comment: 0,0:02:35.01,0:02:38.94,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H5D03FF&}夜空中懸吊的星星就是奇迹
Comment: 0,0:02:38.94,0:02:42.02,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H5D03FF&}純然的愛不需要自我
Comment: 0,0:02:42.89,0:02:45.94,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H19A20C&}我只想一直陪在你的身邊...
